Description: Zovelis OS desktop (metapackage)
 This metapackage installs the complete Zovelis OS desktop: KDE Plasma with
 the Zovelis look, the login screen, hardware support tools, the Software
 Center (Discover) with Flatpak, the firewall settings and the Welcome app.
 .
 The everyday applications (web browser, file manager, terminal, text
 editor, viewers, media players, calculator, screenshot tool, screen
 reader) are recommended rather than required, so any of them can be
 removed without removing the rest of the desktop.
